  "caveats": [
    "The unified archive at jcodemunch_selective_hydration_all_measurements.csv retains exploratory rows at 6996cc08 alongside c2201a55 rows. Filter on jcodemunch_source_sha before aggregating. No 6996cc08 row backs a quoted figure.",
    "The Arc 2 classification screen is one pair per case. 58 of its 144 cases (40.3%) are Express and Gin calls with sub-50ms baselines, which a single pair cannot separate from timing variance. Django 5.17x and FastAPI 2.59x are the load-bearing part.",
    "Two Arc 1 boundary files carry pre-pin rows. generation_boundary_architecture_probe_v1.csv is entirely at 6996cc08. generation_boundary_followups_v1.csv is mixed, holding both 6996cc08 and c2201a55 rows, and records provenance in a `source_sha` column rather than `jcodemunch_source_sha`. Neither backs a quoted figure; both are kept rather than dropped. See provenance_class on each entry below.",
    "The source-run CSVs use several experiment-specific schemas (18, 23, 33 and 34 columns; see the columns field per entry). The unified master CSV normalizes them into one fixed 57-column schema."
  ],
